  "goodToKnow": "Die Gentrifizierung is gentrification: wealthier newcomers move into a district, rents rise and long-time residents are displaced (verdrängt). Berlin's Prenzlauer Berg and Kreuzberg and Hamburg's Schanzenviertel are classic examples. Cities respond with Milieuschutzgebiete and the Mietpreisbremse (rent brake). The word comes from English gentry. It has no plural."
